{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_026yur_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_026yur_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fb70c70d93c39cf6a54a6e71b15176518035cfc8b185f3f602addfe36eaf08a3", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドル候補を探すために、\n巷で評判の学園祭にやってきた）", "zh": "（为了替39PROJECT找寻偶像候补人选，\n我跑来参加颇受好评的学园祭。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
